# Keep text files LF in the repository.
#
# _plugins/multi-comp.md and _plugins/tapemachine.md had drifted to CRLF. That is
# invisible in an editor but breaks anchored line matching: the release tooling
# looks for `^changelog:$` to insert a new entry, and on a CRLF file the line
# really ends `changelog:\r`, so the match silently finds nothing and the release
# ships without a changelog entry. Normalising here stops it recurring.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must not touch.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.flac  binary
